                        <locus target="#14v">-14v</locus>اَ تُرِيْدُوْنَ اَنْ تَجْعَلُوْا لِلهِ عَلَيْكُمْ سُلْطَاناً مُبِيْناً اِنِّ المُنَافِقِيْنَ فِيْ الدَ[رك<note>ḥarakāt under šadda-s</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>4:24-4:144. Twelve lines a page. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Words completed on the following line. Corrections, also in red color. Catchwords from 4v onwards from a later hand. In the margin, ḥizb mark in red.</note>
